---
import Layout from "../layouts/main.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Impressum"
  description="Legal information about Pascal Giessler's website including contact details and liability disclaimers."
  keywords="Pascal Giessler, Impressum, Legal Notice, Contact Information"
>
  <main class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 pt-28 pb-24 lg:pt-36">

    <div class="mb-10">
      <p class="section-label mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1
        style="font-family: 'Cormorant', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text);"
      >
        Impressum
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div
      class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-7"
      style="color: var(--text-2);"
    >

      <div>
        <h2
          class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold"
          style="color: var(--text); font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;"
        >
          Information according to § 5 TMG
        </h2>
        <p>
          Dr. Pascal Giessler<br />
          Ausstrasse 14<br />
          79288 Gottenheim<br />
          Germany
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2
          class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold"
          style="color: var(--text); font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;"
        >
          Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          Email:
          <a
            href="mailto:info@pascal-giessler.de"
            style="color: var(--gold-light); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;"
          >
            info@pascal-giessler.de
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2
          class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold"
          style="color: var(--text); font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;"
        >
          Liability for Content
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          As a service provider, I am responsible for my own content on these pages according to § 7 paragraph 1 TMG. According to §§ 8 to 10 TMG, I am not obligated to monitor transmitted or stored third-party information or to investigate circumstances that indicate illegal activity.
        </p>
        <p>
          Obligations to remove or block the use of information under general law remain unaffected. Liability in this regard is only possible from the point in time at which a concrete infringement of the law becomes known. If I become aware of any such infringements, I will remove the relevant content immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2
          class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold"
          style="color: var(--text); font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;"
        >
          Liability for Links
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          My website contains links to external websites of third parties, on whose contents I have no influence. Therefore, I cannot assume any liability for these external contents. The respective provider or operator of the pages is always responsible for the contents of the linked pages.
        </p>
        <p>
          A permanent control of the contents of the linked pages is not reasonable without concrete evidence of a violation of law. If I become aware of any infringements, I will remove such links immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2
          class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold"
          style="color: var(--text); font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;"
        >
          Privacy and analytics
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          This site uses a self-hosted instance of
          <a
            href="https://openpanel.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            style="color: var(--gold-light); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;"
          >OpenPanel</a>
          to measure traffic. The analytics run on my own infrastructure. No external analytics
          provider is involved, and no data is shared with or sold to third parties.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Measurement is <strong style="color: var(--text);">cookieless</strong> and does no
          cross-site tracking. What is recorded: pages viewed, referrer, coarse region, and browser
          and device class. The IP address is only used to derive an anonymous, non-reversible
          identifier and is not stored. Individual visitors cannot be identified.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">
          The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. The legitimate interest is the statistical analysis
          of usage in order to improve the content of this site.
        </p>
        <p>
          If your browser sends a <em>Do Not Track</em> signal or a <em>Global Privacy Control</em>
          declaration, no measurement takes place at all. You do not need to do anything else.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2
          class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold"
          style="color: var(--text); font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;"
        >
          Copyright
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          The contents and works on these pages created by the site operators are subject to German copyright law. Duplication, processing, distribution, and any exploitation outside the limits of copyright require the written consent of the respective author or creator.
        </p>
        <p>
          Insofar as the content on this site was not created by the operator, the copyrights of third parties are respected. In particular, third-party content is marked as such. Should you become aware of a copyright infringement, please inform me accordingly.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
